# =======================================================================
# tests/ (root) — Root-Level Test Helpers & One-Off Scripts
# =======================================================================
# PURPOSE:
#   This root-level tests/ directory holds standalone helper scripts that
#   are NOT part of the main pytest suite (which lives in backend/tests/).
#   These are convenience scripts for generating test fixtures, seeding
#   sample data, or performing manual integration checks.
#
# IMPORTANT — DO NOT COMMIT FILES HERE:
#   All scripts inside this directory are intentionally excluded from Git
#   via .gitignore. Only this .gitkeep file is tracked to preserve the
#   directory structure.
#
# REAL TESTS LIVE IN:
#   backend/tests/          → pytest unit + integration tests (committed)
#     test_chat.py          → Chat & SSE streaming tests
#     test_day2_pipeline.py → Text cleaning & chunking pipeline
#     test_day5_agents.py   → Router/Rewriter & CRAG agents
#     test_day6.py          → Hallucination Grader & Quiz Agent
#     test_day7.py          → Auth, document isolation & streaming
#
# EXAMPLES OF WHAT GOES HERE (locally only):
#   - create_test_pdfs.py  → Generate sample PDFs for upload testing
#   - seed_db.py           → Populate DB with demo documents/sessions
#   - manual_rag_check.py  → Hand-verify a RAG query end-to-end
#
# HOW TO RUN THE REAL TESTS:
#   cd backend
#   .venv\Scripts\pytest tests/ -v
# =======================================================================
